sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operator
  participant UI as POS UI
  participant UseCase as Refund/Reversal Use Case
  participant Repo as Transaction Repository
  participant Processor as Mock Processor
  Operator->>UI: Select original transaction
  UI->>UseCase: Request refund or reversal with distinct idempotency key
  UseCase->>Repo: Load original transaction and operation history
  Repo-->>UseCase: Original status and prior operations
  UseCase->>UseCase: Validate operation-specific preconditions
  alt Invalid state or duplicate operation
    UseCase-->>UI: Reject with safe reason
  else Valid request
    UseCase->>Repo: Persist pending operation linked to original
    UseCase->>Processor: Submit synthetic refund/reversal
    alt Confirmed result
      Processor-->>UseCase: Approved / declined
      UseCase->>Repo: Persist final operation state
      UseCase-->>UI: Display result and reference
    else Timeout or unknown response
      Processor--xUseCase: Ambiguous outcome
      UseCase->>Repo: Mark UNKNOWN_OUTCOME and reconciliation required
      UseCase-->>UI: Show pending confirmation; do not resubmit as new operation
    end
  end
